  "note": "The golden fixture for the UCT RS QUALITY (Clenow) columns (engineering map 2026-11-08 unit 3-03; plan §7.15; KB 01-methodologies §4), read by tests/test_rs_phase3_math.py against api/services/relative_strength.clenow_columns. 80 DAILY bars (t = 1735776000 + i×86400). params.window = 20 (the product default is 90, kept short so the fixture exercises warm-up, both gaps and the regime change in one file); params.gap_pct = 15. FORMULA over the last 20 valid closes ending at bar t: b = OLS slope of ln C on the ordinal 0..19; clenowAnnual = (1 + b)^252 − 1 (a fraction); clenowR2 = R² of that fit; clenowScore = clenowAnnual × clenowR2; clenowGap = 1.0 when any consecutive pair INSIDE the window moved |C[t] − C[t−1]| / C[t−1] × 100 > 15 (strict), else 0.0. All four columns null at bars 0-18 (warm-up window − 1). SHAPE: bars 0-24 rise about 0.8 % a bar to exactly 100.00; BAR 25 = 115.00, a move of (115.00 − 100.00) / 100.00 × 100 = 15.0 EXACTLY, which is NOT > 15, so no window holding it flags (clenowGap 0.0 at bars 25-43, the windows containing the pair); bars 26-44 rise about 0.5 % a bar; bars 45-59 fall about 1 % a bar (clenowAnnual negative, e.g. bar 59 = −0.873744, R² 0.934212); BAR 60 = 89.82 after 108.22, a move of 18.40 / 108.22 × 100 = 17.0024 > 15, so clenowGap = 1.0 at exactly bars 60-78 (every 20-bar window containing bars 59 and 60) and 0.0 again at bar 79, whose window starts at bar 60; bars 61-79 chop sideways (bar 79: annual 0.030877, R² 0.002563, score 0.000079 — a flat, noisy path scores near zero however it ends). No other one-bar move reaches 14 %. Values: a one-off generator (not committed; regeneration is banned, _schema.md) that never imports relative_strength computed b with numpy.polyfit, R² as numpy.corrcoef(x, ln C)² and the moves in exact rational arithmetic, asserting every claim above before writing. 2026-11-07.",
